sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Maintainer
    participant Ctrl as MaintenanceController
    participant Service as MaintenanceService
    participant StaffSvc as StaffService
    participant DB as Database

    note right of Client: POST /maintenance/issues/:id/prove (Bearer Token)
    Client->>Ctrl: ProveIssueDto
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: AuthGuard & RolesGuard (Maintainer | Manager)

    Ctrl->>Service: proveIssue(maintainerAccountId, issueId, dto)
    activate Service

    Service->>StaffSvc: findByAccountId(maintainerAccountId)
    StaffSvc-->>Service: StaffInfo

    alt Staff not found
        Service-->>Client: 403 Forbidden (Staff profile not found)
    end

    Service->>DB: Check IssueAssignment (issueId, maintainerId)
    DB-->>Service: IssueAssignment

    alt Not assigned
        Service-->>Client: 403 Forbidden (not assigned)
    end

    Service->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Service->>DB: INSERT MaintenanceProves
    Service->>DB: UPDATE IssueReports.status = 'Resolved'
    Service->>DB: COMMIT
    DB-->>Service: MaintenanceProve

    Service-->>Ctrl: MaintenanceProve
    deactivate Service

    Ctrl-->>Client: 201 Created
    deactivate Ctrl
